  "interpretation": "A transition exit 10 means >=25 deaths in 2016 and <25 in 2017. A probability of exact first exit in 2017 from 2014 is only defined as active-state first exit if 2014 was itself active in that source vintage. GED21 vs GED22 reclassifies 2013–15, including 2014. Any comparison must use the same vintage-defined event and horizon. This is a source-vintage stress test, not the original 2016-issued forecast, not calibrated skill and not an inference of actual causal mechanisms. The 2023 CY support mask used to align exposure is retrospective and not as-of.",
